# AI Coding Standards

- Avoid using `eslint-disable`.
- Always prefer fixing the root cause of linting errors.
- For hooks like `useMemo` that return complex types (e.g., React Native styles), provide an explicit return type (e.g., `: StyleProp<ViewStyle>`) to help the compiler and satisfy lint rules.
